+// --tex-replay: the res-512 TRELLIS.2 texture stage alone (the decode_texture(false) path of
+// trellis_run for a non-cascade, non-Pixal3D run), then the run's own POST dump with only the PBR
+// block replaced. The flags (low-VRAM caps, FA precision, scheduler) are the ones trellis_run set.
+static int tex_replay_run(const trellis::TrellisParams& cfg, bool F32, double t0) {
